      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHIMMERING MISS (5) has a terrific record this trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Scored by a neck last time (16.60) in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Expected to be in the finish. METHANOL OUTLAW (1) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 1.2 lengths from the winner (16.87). Has a strong record from box 1, including three wins. Has ability and can atone. ONYX FLAME (8) finished well back at this track last time when a 5.5 lengths seventh (16.84) but scored five back at this track (19.27). The form from her last run stacks up well. Likely to be thereabouts. RUSTY ROY (7) has ability and must be included among the main hopes.",
